name newverbs
category Package
revision 58256
shortdesc Define new versions of \verb, including short verb versions
longdesc The package allows the definition of \verb variants which add
longdesc TeX code before and after the verbatim text (e.g., quotes or
longdesc surrounding \fbox{}). When used together with the shortvrb
longdesc package it allows the definition of short verbatim characters
longdesc which use this package's variant instead of the normal \verb.
longdesc In addition, it is possible to collect an argument verbatim to
longdesc either typeset or write it into a file. The \Verbdef command
longdesc defines verbatim text to a macro which can later be used to
longdesc write the verbatim text to a file.
